OL,9,G0350FWitness History
OL,10,     GOn 31 December 1999, a piece of
OL,11,     Gmusic started playing in a
OL,12,     Glighthouse in East London. It's
OL,13,     Gcalled Longplayer, and it's set
OL,14,     Gto keep going, without repeating,
OL,15,     Guntil the year 2999.
